(function(){var T=window.TRANSLATIONS;if(!T)return;var d={"tr":{"blog_p108_powderwet_title":"Toz Boya mı, Yaş Boya mı? Kaynaklı Çelik Parçada Kaplama Seçimi | ArmaWeld","blog_p108_powderwet_meta_desc":"Kaynaklı çelik parçalar için elektrostatik toz boya ile endüstriyel yaş boya sistemlerinin karşılaştırması: parça boyutu, korozyon sınıfı, kalınlık, rötuş, galvaniz üzeri uygulama, kaynak gözenekleri ve siparişte belirtilmesi gerekenler.","blog_p108_powderwet_og_title":"Toz boya mı yaş boya mı","blog_p108_powderwet_tag":"Teknik Rehber · Yüzey İşlem","blog_p108_powderwet_h1":"Toz Boya mı, Yaş Boya mı? Kaynaklı Çelik Parçada Kaplama Seçimi","blog_p108_powderwet_breadcrumb3":"Toz boya veya yaş boya","blog_p108_powderwet_read":"6 dk okuma","blog_p108_powderwet_body":"<p>Kaynaklı bir parçanın teklifini isterken \"boyalı\" demek, genellikle iki çok farklı süreci kapsar: elektrostatik toz boya ve sıvı (yaş) boya. Her ikisi de doğru yerde çok iyi sonuç verir; yanlış yerde ise erken korozyon, kabuklanma veya sahada onarılamayan hasarlar ortaya çıkar.</p>\n<h2>Toz Boya</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Nasıl çalışır:</strong> Toz, elektrostatik olarak parçaya püskürtülür ve fırında kürlenir.</li>\n<li><strong>Güçlü yanları:</strong> Düzgün kalınlık, iyi darbe ve çizik direnci, geniş renk ve doku seçeneği, solvent içermemesi.</li>\n<li><strong>Sınırları:</strong> Parça boyutu fırın ve hat ölçüsüyle sınırlıdır; kalın ve ağır parçalar fırında geç ısınır. Sahada rötuş toz boya ile yapılamaz, sıvı boya ile yapılır ve renk tonu farkı görülebilir.</li>\n<li><strong>Kaynakla ilgili risk:</strong> Kaynak gözenekleri ve dar boşluklarda kalan hava, kürleme sırasında genleşip kaplamada iğne deliği (pinhole) bırakabilir. Galvaniz üzeri toz boyada da benzer gaz çıkışı görülür; ön ısıtma veya uygun astar gerekebilir.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Yaş (Sıvı) Boya</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Nasıl çalışır:</strong> Astar, ara kat ve son kat gibi katmanlar halinde püskürtme veya fırça ile uygulanır.</li>\n<li><strong>Güçlü yanları:</strong> Parça boyutu sınırı yoktur; ISO 12944'e göre yüksek korozyon sınıfları için kalın, çok katlı sistemler kurulabilir (bkz. <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944 sınıfları</a>). Sahada aynı sistemle onarılabilir.</li>\n<li><strong>Sınırları:</strong> Kuruma süresi, kat arası bekleme ve ortam koşullarına (sıcaklık, nem, çiy noktası) duyarlılık.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Hangisini Seçmeli?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Makine parçaları, iç mekân ekipmanı, orta boy parçalar:</strong> Toz boya çoğu zaman ekonomik ve şıktır.</li>\n<li><strong>Büyük yapılar, dış ortam, deniz ve endüstriyel atmosfer:</strong> Çok katlı yaş boya sistemi veya galvaniz üzeri boya (dupleks).</li>\n<li><strong>Sahada montaj sırasında hasar görecek parçalar:</strong> Onarılabilirlik nedeniyle yaş boya avantajlıdır.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Her İki Durumda da</h2>\n<p>Kaplamanın ömrünü yüzey hazırlığı belirler: kumlama derecesi, yüzey profili ve kaynak hazırlığı siparişte tanımlanmalıdır (bkz. <a href=\"kumlama-sa-2-5-yuzey-hazirligi-kaynakli-parca.html\">kumlama ve Sa 2½</a>). Askı noktaları, maskelenecek yüzeyler (dişler, işlenmiş yüzeyler, topraklama noktaları), renk kodu (RAL vb.), parlaklık ve kuru film kalınlığı da yazılmalıdır.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>ArmaWeld'de:</strong> Parçayı kaplamaya uygun hazırlıyor, askı noktalarını ve maskeleme ihtiyacını imalat sırasında planlıyoruz. Kumlama, toz boya, yaş boya ve galvanizi iş ortaklarımızla koordine ediyoruz. <a href=\"../kaynakli-imalat.html\">Kaynaklı imalat →</a></p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_faq":"<h2>Sık Sorulan Sorular</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Toz boya her parçaya uygun mu?</h3><p>Hayır; parça boyutu fırınla sınırlıdır ve sahada aynı malzemeyle rötuş yapılamaz.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Dış ortamda hangisi daha iyi?</h3><p>Yüksek korozyon sınıflarında çok katlı yaş boya veya galvaniz üzeri boya (dupleks) yaygındır.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Toz boyada iğne deliği neden olur?</h3><p>Kaynak gözenekleri, dar boşluklar veya galvanizden çıkan gaz kürleme sırasında kaplamayı deler.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Siparişte ne yazılmalı?</h3><p>Kaplama tipi, yüzey hazırlığı, renk ve parlaklık, film kalınlığı ve maskelenecek yüzeyler.</p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_h3":"Boyalı kaynaklı parça mı lazım?","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_p":"Çizimleri ve kaplama şartlarını gönderin; teklifimizi hazırlayalım.","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_btn":"Teklif İste →","blog_related_h":"İlgili Makaleler","blog_p107_blasting_h1":"Kumlama ve Sa 2½: Kaynaklı Parçada Boya Öncesi Yüzey Hazırlığını Doğru Sipariş Etmek","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 Korozyon Sınıfları C1–C5 ve CX: Kaynaklı Çelik Parçada Boya Sistemi Seçimi","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Sıcak Daldırma Galvaniz Yapılacak Kaynaklı Parça Nasıl Tasarlanır? Delikler, Kaynak ve Çelik Seçimi","blog_p106_architectural_h1":"Mimari Çelik ve Görünür Kaynaklar: Görünüm Sınıfı, Numune Onayı ve Taşlama"},"en":{"blog_p108_powderwet_title":"Powder Coating or Wet Paint? Choosing a Coating for Welded Steel Parts | ArmaWeld","blog_p108_powderwet_meta_desc":"Comparing electrostatic powder coating and industrial liquid paint systems for welded steel parts: part size, corrosivity category, film build, touch-up, coating over galvanising, weld porosity and what to specify in the order.","blog_p108_powderwet_og_title":"Powder coating or wet paint","blog_p108_powderwet_tag":"Technical Guide · Surface Treatment","blog_p108_powderwet_h1":"Powder Coating or Wet Paint? Choosing a Coating for Welded Steel Parts","blog_p108_powderwet_breadcrumb3":"Powder or wet paint","blog_p108_powderwet_read":"6 min read","blog_p108_powderwet_body":"<p>Asking for a quote on a \"painted\" welded part usually covers two very different processes: electrostatic powder coating and liquid (wet) paint. Both work very well in the right place; in the wrong place you get early corrosion, flaking or damage that cannot be repaired on site.</p>\n<h2>Powder Coating</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>How it works:</strong> powder is sprayed electrostatically and cured in an oven.</li>\n<li><strong>Strengths:</strong> even thickness, good impact and scratch resistance, wide range of colours and textures, no solvents.</li>\n<li><strong>Limits:</strong> part size is limited by oven and line; thick, heavy parts heat slowly. Site touch-up is done with liquid paint, and a shade difference may show.</li>\n<li><strong>Welding-related risk:</strong> air in weld pores and tight gaps expands during curing and can leave pinholes. Powder over galvanising shows similar outgassing; preheating or a suitable primer may be needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Wet (Liquid) Paint</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>How it works:</strong> applied in layers such as primer, intermediate and topcoat by spray or brush.</li>\n<li><strong>Strengths:</strong> no size limit; thick multi-coat systems for high ISO 12944 categories (see <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944 categories</a>). Repairable on site with the same system.</li>\n<li><strong>Limits:</strong> drying and recoat times, sensitivity to temperature, humidity and dew point.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Which to Choose?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Machine parts, indoor equipment, medium-sized parts:</strong> powder is often economical and attractive.</li>\n<li><strong>Large structures, outdoor, marine and industrial atmospheres:</strong> multi-coat liquid systems or paint over galvanising (duplex).</li>\n<li><strong>Parts likely to be damaged during erection:</strong> wet paint is easier to repair.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>In Either Case</h2>\n<p>Surface preparation decides coating life: specify blast grade, profile and weld preparation (see <a href=\"kumlama-sa-2-5-yuzey-hazirligi-kaynakli-parca.html\">blast cleaning and Sa 2½</a>). Also state hanging points, surfaces to mask (threads, machined faces, earthing points), colour code (RAL etc.), gloss and dry film thickness.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>At ArmaWeld:</strong> we prepare parts for coating and plan hanging points and masking during fabrication. Blasting, powder coating, wet painting and galvanising are coordinated with our partners. <a href=\"../kaynakli-imalat.html\">Welded fabrication →</a></p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_faq":"<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Does powder suit every part?</h3><p>No; size is limited by the oven and site touch-up cannot use powder.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Which is better outdoors?</h3><p>For high corrosivity, multi-coat wet systems or duplex are common.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Why pinholes in powder?</h3><p>Gas from weld pores, tight gaps or galvanising escapes during curing.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>What should the order state?</h3><p>Coating type, surface preparation, colour and gloss, film thickness and masking.</p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_h3":"Need coated welded parts?","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_p":"Send drawings and coating requirements; we will prepare our quote.","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_btn":"Request a Quote →","blog_related_h":"Related Articles","blog_p107_blasting_h1":"Blast Cleaning and Sa 2½: Ordering Surface Preparation for Welded Parts Correctly","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 Corrosivity Categories C1–C5 and CX: Choosing a Coating System for Welded Steel","blog_n29_galv_h1":"How to Design Welded Parts for Hot-Dip Galvanizing: Holes, Welding and Steel Selection","blog_p106_architectural_h1":"Architectural Steel and Exposed Welds: Appearance Grades, Mock-up Approval and Grinding"},"de":{"blog_p108_powderwet_title":"Pulverbeschichtung oder Nasslack? Beschichtungswahl für Schweißteile aus Stahl | ArmaWeld","blog_p108_powderwet_meta_desc":"Vergleich von Pulverbeschichtung und industriellen Nasslacksystemen für geschweißte Stahlteile: Teilegröße, Korrosivitätskategorie, Schichtdicke, Ausbesserung, Beschichtung auf Verzinkung, Schweißporen und Angaben in der Bestellung.","blog_p108_powderwet_og_title":"Pulverbeschichtung oder Nasslack","blog_p108_powderwet_tag":"Technischer Leitfaden · Oberflächentechnik","blog_p108_powderwet_h1":"Pulverbeschichtung oder Nasslack? Beschichtungswahl für Schweißteile aus Stahl","blog_p108_powderwet_breadcrumb3":"Pulver oder Nasslack","blog_p108_powderwet_read":"6 Min. Lesezeit","blog_p108_powderwet_body":"<p>„Lackiert\" in einer Anfrage für ein Schweißteil umfasst meist zwei sehr verschiedene Verfahren: elektrostatische Pulverbeschichtung und Flüssig- bzw. Nasslack. Beide funktionieren am richtigen Ort sehr gut; am falschen drohen Frühkorrosion, Abplatzungen oder Schäden, die sich vor Ort nicht reparieren lassen.</p>\n<h2>Pulverbeschichtung</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Prinzip:</strong> Pulver wird elektrostatisch aufgetragen und im Ofen eingebrannt.</li>\n<li><strong>Stärken:</strong> gleichmäßige Schichtdicke, gute Schlag- und Kratzfestigkeit, große Farb- und Strukturauswahl, lösemittelfrei.</li>\n<li><strong>Grenzen:</strong> Teilegröße durch Ofen und Anlage begrenzt; dicke, schwere Teile erwärmen sich langsam. Ausbesserung vor Ort erfolgt mit Nasslack, Farbtonabweichungen sind möglich.</li>\n<li><strong>Schweißbezogenes Risiko:</strong> Luft in Poren und engen Spalten dehnt sich beim Einbrennen aus und hinterlässt Nadelstiche. Pulver auf Verzinkung zeigt ähnliches Ausgasen; Vorwärmen oder geeigneter Primer kann nötig sein.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Nasslack</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Prinzip:</strong> schichtweise als Grund-, Zwischen- und Deckbeschichtung gespritzt oder gestrichen.</li>\n<li><strong>Stärken:</strong> keine Größengrenze; dicke Mehrschichtsysteme für hohe Kategorien nach ISO 12944 (siehe <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944</a>). Vor Ort mit gleichem System reparierbar.</li>\n<li><strong>Grenzen:</strong> Trocken- und Überarbeitungszeiten, Empfindlichkeit gegenüber Temperatur, Feuchte und Taupunkt.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Was wählen?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Maschinenteile, Innenausrüstung, mittelgroße Teile:</strong> Pulver ist oft wirtschaftlich und optisch ansprechend.</li>\n<li><strong>Große Bauteile, außen, maritim, Industrieatmosphäre:</strong> Mehrschicht-Nasslack oder Duplex (Verzinkung plus Beschichtung).</li>\n<li><strong>Teile mit Montageschadenrisiko:</strong> Nasslack ist leichter auszubessern.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>In jedem Fall</h2>\n<p>Die Oberflächenvorbereitung bestimmt die Lebensdauer: Strahlgrad, Rauheitsprofil und Nahtvorbereitung festlegen (siehe <a href=\"kumlama-sa-2-5-yuzey-hazirligi-kaynakli-parca.html\">Strahlen und Sa 2½</a>). Außerdem Aufhängepunkte, Abdeckungen (Gewinde, bearbeitete Flächen, Erdungspunkte), Farbton (RAL usw.), Glanzgrad und Trockenschichtdicke angeben.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bei ArmaWeld:</strong> Wir bereiten Teile beschichtungsgerecht vor und planen Aufhängepunkte und Abdeckungen schon in der Fertigung. Strahlen, Pulverbeschichtung, Nasslack und Verzinkung koordinieren wir mit Partnern. <a href=\"../kaynakli-imalat.html\">Schweißfertigung →</a></p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_faq":"<h2>Häufige Fragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Passt Pulver für jedes Teil?</h3><p>Nein; die Größe ist durch den Ofen begrenzt, und vor Ort wird nicht mit Pulver ausgebessert.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Was ist außen besser?</h3><p>Bei hoher Korrosivität Mehrschicht-Nasslack oder Duplex.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Warum Nadelstiche im Pulver?</h3><p>Gas aus Poren, Spalten oder Verzinkung entweicht beim Einbrennen.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Was gehört in die Bestellung?</h3><p>Beschichtungsart, Vorbereitung, Farbton und Glanz, Schichtdicke und Abdeckungen.</p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_h3":"Beschichtete Schweißteile benötigt?","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_p":"Senden Sie Zeichnungen und Beschichtungsvorgaben; wir erstellen unser Angebot.","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_btn":"Angebot anfordern →","blog_related_h":"Verwandte Artikel","blog_p107_blasting_h1":"Strahlen und Sa 2½: Oberflächenvorbereitung für Schweißteile richtig bestellen","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 Korrosivitätskategorien C1–C5 und CX: Beschichtungssystem für geschweißte Stahlteile","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Schweißteile feuerverzinkungsgerecht konstruieren: Bohrungen, Schweißen und Stahlauswahl","blog_p106_architectural_h1":"Sichtstahlbau und sichtbare Schweißnähte: Anforderungsklassen, Musterfreigabe und Schleifen"},"es":{"blog_p108_powderwet_title":"¿Pintura en polvo o líquida? Elegir el recubrimiento de piezas soldadas de acero | ArmaWeld","blog_p108_powderwet_meta_desc":"Comparativa entre pintura en polvo electrostática y sistemas de pintura líquida industrial para piezas soldadas: tamaño de pieza, categoría de corrosividad, espesor, retoques, pintura sobre galvanizado, poros de soldadura y qué indicar en el pedido.","blog_p108_powderwet_og_title":"Pintura en polvo o líquida","blog_p108_powderwet_tag":"Guía técnica · Tratamiento superficial","blog_p108_powderwet_h1":"¿Pintura en polvo o líquida? Elegir el recubrimiento de piezas soldadas de acero","blog_p108_powderwet_breadcrumb3":"Polvo o líquida","blog_p108_powderwet_read":"6 min de lectura","blog_p108_powderwet_body":"<p>Pedir una pieza soldada \"pintada\" suele abarcar dos procesos muy distintos: pintura en polvo electrostática y pintura líquida. Ambas funcionan muy bien en su sitio; en el sitio equivocado aparecen corrosión prematura, desconchados o daños que no se pueden reparar en obra.</p>\n<h2>Pintura en polvo</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cómo funciona:</strong> el polvo se aplica electrostáticamente y se cura en horno.</li>\n<li><strong>Ventajas:</strong> espesor uniforme, buena resistencia a golpes y rayas, amplia gama de colores y texturas, sin disolventes.</li>\n<li><strong>Límites:</strong> tamaño limitado por horno y línea; piezas gruesas se calientan despacio. El retoque en obra se hace con líquida y puede notarse el tono.</li>\n<li><strong>Riesgo por soldadura:</strong> el aire en poros y rendijas se expande al curar y deja picaduras. Sobre galvanizado ocurre algo similar; puede requerir precalentamiento o imprimación adecuada.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Pintura líquida</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cómo funciona:</strong> por capas (imprimación, intermedia y acabado) a pistola o brocha.</li>\n<li><strong>Ventajas:</strong> sin límite de tamaño; sistemas multicapa para categorías altas de ISO 12944 (ver <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944</a>). Reparable en obra con el mismo sistema.</li>\n<li><strong>Límites:</strong> tiempos de secado y repintado, sensibilidad a temperatura, humedad y punto de rocío.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>¿Cuál elegir?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Piezas de máquina, equipos de interior, piezas medianas:</strong> el polvo suele ser económico y estético.</li>\n<li><strong>Estructuras grandes, exterior, marino e industrial:</strong> sistemas líquidos multicapa o dúplex.</li>\n<li><strong>Piezas con riesgo de daño en montaje:</strong> la líquida es más fácil de reparar.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>En ambos casos</h2>\n<p>La preparación decide la vida del recubrimiento: indique grado de granallado, perfil y preparación de soldaduras (ver <a href=\"kumlama-sa-2-5-yuzey-hazirligi-kaynakli-parca.html\">granallado y Sa 2½</a>). Además, puntos de cuelgue, zonas a enmascarar (roscas, caras mecanizadas, tomas de tierra), color (RAL, etc.), brillo y espesor de película seca.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>En ArmaWeld:</strong> preparamos las piezas para el recubrimiento y planificamos cuelgues y enmascarado durante la fabricación. Granallado, polvo, líquida y galvanizado se coordinan con socios. <a href=\"../kaynakli-imalat.html\">Fabricación soldada →</a></p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_faq":"<h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿El polvo sirve para todo?</h3><p>No; el horno limita el tamaño y el retoque en obra no se hace con polvo.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué es mejor en exterior?</h3><p>Con corrosividad alta, sistemas líquidos multicapa o dúplex.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Por qué picaduras en el polvo?</h3><p>Gas de poros, rendijas o galvanizado que sale al curar.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué indicar en el pedido?</h3><p>Tipo, preparación, color y brillo, espesor y enmascarado.</p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_h3":"¿Necesita piezas soldadas pintadas?","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_p":"Envíe planos y requisitos de pintura; prepararemos la oferta.","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_btn":"Solicitar oferta →","blog_related_h":"Artículos relacionados","blog_p107_blasting_h1":"Granallado y Sa 2½: cómo pedir bien la preparación superficial de piezas soldadas","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 categorías de corrosividad C1–C5 y CX: elegir el sistema de pintura para acero soldado","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Cómo diseñar piezas soldadas para galvanizado en caliente: agujeros, soldadura y elección del acero","blog_p106_architectural_h1":"Acero arquitectónico y soldaduras vistas: grados de acabado, aprobación de muestra y amolado"},"fr":{"blog_p108_powderwet_title":"Peinture poudre ou liquide ? Choisir le revêtement des pièces soudées en acier | ArmaWeld","blog_p108_powderwet_meta_desc":"Comparatif entre thermolaquage poudre et systèmes de peinture liquide industrielle pour pièces soudées : taille des pièces, catégorie de corrosivité, épaisseur, retouches, peinture sur galvanisation, porosités de soudure et mentions à la commande.","blog_p108_powderwet_og_title":"Peinture poudre ou liquide","blog_p108_powderwet_tag":"Guide technique · Traitement de surface","blog_p108_powderwet_h1":"Peinture poudre ou liquide ? Choisir le revêtement des pièces soudées en acier","blog_p108_powderwet_breadcrumb3":"Poudre ou liquide","blog_p108_powderwet_read":"6 min de lecture","blog_p108_powderwet_body":"<p>Demander une pièce soudée « peinte » recouvre souvent deux procédés très différents : thermolaquage poudre et peinture liquide. Les deux donnent d'excellents résultats au bon endroit ; au mauvais, on obtient corrosion précoce, écaillage ou dégâts irréparables sur site.</p>\n<h2>Thermolaquage poudre</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Principe :</strong> poudre projetée électrostatiquement puis cuite au four.</li>\n<li><strong>Atouts :</strong> épaisseur régulière, bonne tenue aux chocs et rayures, large choix de teintes et textures, sans solvant.</li>\n<li><strong>Limites :</strong> taille limitée par le four et la ligne ; les pièces épaisses chauffent lentement. Les retouches sur site se font en liquide, avec un écart de teinte possible.</li>\n<li><strong>Risque lié au soudage :</strong> l'air des porosités et interstices se dilate à la cuisson et laisse des piqûres. Sur galvanisation, dégazage similaire ; préchauffage ou primaire adapté parfois nécessaire.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Peinture liquide</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Principe :</strong> en couches (primaire, intermédiaire, finition) au pistolet ou à la brosse.</li>\n<li><strong>Atouts :</strong> pas de limite de taille ; systèmes multicouches pour catégories élevées de l'ISO 12944 (voir <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944</a>). Réparable sur site avec le même système.</li>\n<li><strong>Limites :</strong> temps de séchage et de recouvrement, sensibilité à la température, à l'humidité et au point de rosée.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Que choisir ?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pièces de machines, équipements intérieurs, pièces moyennes :</strong> la poudre est souvent économique et esthétique.</li>\n<li><strong>Grandes structures, extérieur, marin, industriel :</strong> systèmes liquides multicouches ou duplex.</li>\n<li><strong>Pièces exposées aux chocs au montage :</strong> le liquide se répare plus facilement.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Dans tous les cas</h2>\n<p>La préparation conditionne la durée de vie : préciser degré de grenaillage, profil et préparation des soudures (voir <a href=\"kumlama-sa-2-5-yuzey-hazirligi-kaynakli-parca.html\">grenaillage et Sa 2½</a>). Indiquer aussi points d'accrochage, masquages (filetages, faces usinées, points de masse), teinte (RAL…), brillance et épaisseur de film sec.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Chez ArmaWeld :</strong> nous préparons les pièces pour le revêtement et prévoyons accrochages et masquages dès la fabrication. Grenaillage, poudre, liquide et galvanisation sont coordonnés avec nos partenaires. <a href=\"../kaynakli-imalat.html\">Fabrication soudée →</a></p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_faq":"<h2>Questions fréquentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>La poudre convient-elle à toutes les pièces ?</h3><p>Non ; le four limite la taille et les retouches sur site ne se font pas en poudre.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quoi en extérieur ?</h3><p>En forte corrosivité, systèmes liquides multicouches ou duplex.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Pourquoi des piqûres en poudre ?</h3><p>Gaz des porosités, interstices ou galvanisation libéré à la cuisson.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Que préciser à la commande ?</h3><p>Type, préparation, teinte et brillance, épaisseur et masquages.</p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_h3":"Besoin de pièces soudées peintes ?","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_p":"Envoyez plans et exigences de revêtement ; nous préparerons notre devis.","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_btn":"Demander un devis →","blog_related_h":"Articles associés","blog_p107_blasting_h1":"Grenaillage et Sa 2½ : bien commander la préparation de surface des pièces soudées","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 catégories de corrosivité C1–C5 et CX : choisir le système de peinture pour l’acier soudé","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Concevoir une pièce soudée pour la galvanisation à chaud : trous, soudage et choix de l'acier","blog_p106_architectural_h1":"Acier architectural et soudures apparentes : niveaux d'aspect, validation d'échantillon et meulage"},"it":{"blog_p108_powderwet_title":"Verniciatura a polvere o a liquido? Scegliere il rivestimento dei pezzi saldati in acciaio | ArmaWeld","blog_p108_powderwet_meta_desc":"Confronto tra verniciatura a polvere elettrostatica e cicli a liquido industriali per pezzi saldati: dimensioni, categoria di corrosività, spessore, ritocchi, verniciatura su zincato, porosità di saldatura e cosa indicare nell'ordine.","blog_p108_powderwet_og_title":"Verniciatura a polvere o a liquido","blog_p108_powderwet_tag":"Guida tecnica · Trattamenti superficiali","blog_p108_powderwet_h1":"Verniciatura a polvere o a liquido? Scegliere il rivestimento dei pezzi saldati in acciaio","blog_p108_powderwet_breadcrumb3":"Polvere o liquido","blog_p108_powderwet_read":"6 min di lettura","blog_p108_powderwet_body":"<p>Chiedere un pezzo saldato \"verniciato\" comprende spesso due processi molto diversi: verniciatura a polvere elettrostatica e verniciatura a liquido. Entrambe funzionano benissimo al posto giusto; al posto sbagliato si hanno corrosione precoce, distacchi o danni non riparabili in cantiere.</p>\n<h2>Verniciatura a polvere</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Come funziona:</strong> polvere applicata elettrostaticamente e polimerizzata in forno.</li>\n<li><strong>Punti di forza:</strong> spessore uniforme, buona resistenza a urti e graffi, ampia gamma di colori e finiture, senza solventi.</li>\n<li><strong>Limiti:</strong> dimensioni limitate da forno e impianto; pezzi spessi si scaldano lentamente. I ritocchi in cantiere si fanno a liquido, con possibili differenze di tono.</li>\n<li><strong>Rischio legato alla saldatura:</strong> l'aria in pori e fessure si espande in cottura e lascia crateri. Sullo zincato accade lo stesso; possono servire preriscaldo o primer adatto.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Verniciatura a liquido</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Come funziona:</strong> a strati (fondo, intermedio, finitura) a spruzzo o pennello.</li>\n<li><strong>Punti di forza:</strong> nessun limite di dimensione; cicli multistrato per categorie elevate ISO 12944 (vedi <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944</a>). Riparabile in cantiere con lo stesso ciclo.</li>\n<li><strong>Limiti:</strong> tempi di essiccazione e sovraverniciatura, sensibilità a temperatura, umidità e punto di rugiada.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Quale scegliere?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Parti di macchine, attrezzature da interno, pezzi medi:</strong> la polvere è spesso economica ed estetica.</li>\n<li><strong>Grandi strutture, esterni, marino e industriale:</strong> cicli a liquido multistrato o duplex.</li>\n<li><strong>Pezzi a rischio di danni in montaggio:</strong> il liquido si ripara più facilmente.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>In entrambi i casi</h2>\n<p>La preparazione decide la durata: indicare grado di sabbiatura, profilo e preparazione delle saldature (vedi <a href=\"kumlama-sa-2-5-yuzey-hazirligi-kaynakli-parca.html\">sabbiatura e Sa 2½</a>). Indicare anche punti di aggancio, mascherature (filetti, superfici lavorate, punti di massa), colore (RAL ecc.), brillantezza e spessore del film secco.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>In ArmaWeld:</strong> prepariamo i pezzi per il rivestimento e pianifichiamo agganci e mascherature durante la produzione. Sabbiatura, polvere, liquido e zincatura sono coordinati con i partner. <a href=\"../kaynakli-imalat.html\">Carpenteria saldata →</a></p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_faq":"<h2>Domande frequenti</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>La polvere va bene per ogni pezzo?</h3><p>No; il forno limita le dimensioni e i ritocchi in cantiere non si fanno a polvere.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Cosa è meglio all'esterno?</h3><p>Con corrosività elevata, cicli a liquido multistrato o duplex.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Perché i crateri nella polvere?</h3><p>Gas da pori, fessure o zincatura che esce in cottura.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Cosa indicare nell'ordine?</h3><p>Tipo, preparazione, colore e brillantezza, spessore e mascherature.</p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_h3":"Servono pezzi saldati verniciati?","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_p":"Inviate disegni e requisiti di rivestimento; prepareremo l'offerta.","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_btn":"Richiedi offerta →","blog_related_h":"Articoli correlati","blog_p107_blasting_h1":"Sabbiatura e Sa 2½: ordinare correttamente la preparazione superficiale dei pezzi saldati","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 categorie di corrosività C1–C5 e CX: scegliere il ciclo di verniciatura per l’acciaio saldato","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Come progettare pezzi saldati per la zincatura a caldo: fori, saldatura e scelta dell'acciaio","blog_p106_architectural_h1":"Acciaio architettonico e saldature a vista: classi di finitura, campionatura e molatura"},"nl":{"blog_p108_powderwet_title":"Poedercoaten of natlak? Coatingkeuze voor gelaste stalen delen | ArmaWeld","blog_p108_powderwet_meta_desc":"Vergelijking van elektrostatisch poedercoaten en industriële natlaksystemen voor laswerk: afmetingen, corrosiviteitscategorie, laagdikte, bijwerken, coating op verzinkt staal, lasporiën en wat in de order hoort.","blog_p108_powderwet_og_title":"Poedercoaten of natlak","blog_p108_powderwet_tag":"Technische gids · Oppervlaktebehandeling","blog_p108_powderwet_h1":"Poedercoaten of natlak? Coatingkeuze voor gelaste stalen delen","blog_p108_powderwet_breadcrumb3":"Poeder of natlak","blog_p108_powderwet_read":"6 min lezen","blog_p108_powderwet_body":"<p>Een \"gelakt\" lasdeel aanvragen omvat meestal twee heel verschillende processen: elektrostatisch poedercoaten en vloeibare (natte) lak. Beide werken uitstekend op de juiste plek; op de verkeerde plek krijg je vroege corrosie, afbladderen of schade die op locatie niet te herstellen is.</p>\n<h2>Poedercoaten</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Werking:</strong> poeder wordt elektrostatisch aangebracht en in een oven uitgehard.</li>\n<li><strong>Sterktes:</strong> gelijkmatige laagdikte, goede slag- en krasvastheid, veel kleuren en structuren, oplosmiddelvrij.</li>\n<li><strong>Grenzen:</strong> afmetingen beperkt door oven en lijn; dikke delen warmen traag op. Bijwerken op locatie gebeurt met natlak, met mogelijk kleurverschil.</li>\n<li><strong>Lasgerelateerd risico:</strong> lucht in poriën en nauwe spleten zet uit bij het uitharden en geeft speldenprikken. Op verzinkt staal treedt vergelijkbare ontgassing op; voorwarmen of geschikte primer kan nodig zijn.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Natlak</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Werking:</strong> in lagen (grond, tussen, aflak) gespoten of gekwast.</li>\n<li><strong>Sterktes:</strong> geen afmetingsgrens; dikke meerlaagse systemen voor hoge ISO 12944-categorieën (zie <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944</a>). Op locatie met hetzelfde systeem te herstellen.</li>\n<li><strong>Grenzen:</strong> droog- en overschildertijden, gevoelig voor temperatuur, vocht en dauwpunt.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Wat kiezen?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Machineonderdelen, binnenuitrusting, middelgrote delen:</strong> poeder is vaak voordelig en mooi.</li>\n<li><strong>Grote constructies, buiten, maritiem en industrieel:</strong> meerlaagse natlak of duplex.</li>\n<li><strong>Delen met montageschaderisico:</strong> natlak is makkelijker bij te werken.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>In beide gevallen</h2>\n<p>De voorbehandeling bepaalt de levensduur: leg straalgraad, profiel en lasvoorbereiding vast (zie <a href=\"kumlama-sa-2-5-yuzey-hazirligi-kaynakli-parca.html\">stralen en Sa 2½</a>). Vermeld ook ophangpunten, af te plakken vlakken (schroefdraad, bewerkte vlakken, aardpunten), kleur (RAL enz.), glans en droge laagdikte.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bij ArmaWeld:</strong> we bereiden delen coatinggereed voor en plannen ophangpunten en afplakken al tijdens de productie. Stralen, poedercoaten, natlak en verzinken coördineren we met partners. <a href=\"../kaynakli-imalat.html\">Laswerk →</a></p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_faq":"<h2>Veelgestelde vragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Is poeder geschikt voor elk deel?</h3><p>Nee; de oven beperkt de afmetingen en bijwerken op locatie gaat niet met poeder.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wat is beter buiten?</h3><p>Bij hoge corrosiviteit meerlaagse natlak of duplex.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Waarom speldenprikken in poeder?</h3><p>Gas uit poriën, spleten of verzinking ontsnapt bij het uitharden.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wat hoort in de order?</h3><p>Type, voorbehandeling, kleur en glans, laagdikte en afplakken.</p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_h3":"Gecoat laswerk nodig?","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_p":"Stuur tekeningen en coatingeisen; we stellen een offerte op.","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_btn":"Offerte aanvragen →","blog_related_h":"Gerelateerde artikelen","blog_p107_blasting_h1":"Stralen en Sa 2½: oppervlaktevoorbereiding voor laswerk goed bestellen","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 corrosiviteitscategorieën C1–C5 en CX: coatingsysteem kiezen voor gelast staal","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Gelaste onderdelen ontwerpen voor thermisch verzinken: gaten, lassen en staalkeuze","blog_p106_architectural_h1":"Architectonisch staal en zichtlassen: afwerkingsklassen, proefstuk en slijpen"},"no":{"blog_p108_powderwet_title":"Pulverlakk eller våtlakk? Valg av belegg for sveisede ståldeler | ArmaWeld","blog_p108_powderwet_meta_desc":"Sammenligning av elektrostatisk pulverlakk og industrielle våtlakksystemer for sveisedeler: delstørrelse, korrosivitetskategori, filmtykkelse, flekkreparasjon, maling på forsinket stål, sveiseporer og hva som skal stå i ordren.","blog_p108_powderwet_og_title":"Pulverlakk eller våtlakk","blog_p108_powderwet_tag":"Teknisk guide · Overflatebehandling","blog_p108_powderwet_h1":"Pulverlakk eller våtlakk? Valg av belegg for sveisede ståldeler","blog_p108_powderwet_breadcrumb3":"Pulver eller våtlakk","blog_p108_powderwet_read":"6 min lesing","blog_p108_powderwet_body":"<p>Å be om en \"malt\" sveisedel dekker ofte to svært ulike prosesser: elektrostatisk pulverlakk og flytende (våt) maling. Begge fungerer svært godt på riktig sted; på feil sted får du tidlig korrosjon, avflassing eller skader som ikke kan repareres på stedet.</p>\n<h2>Pulverlakk</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Prinsipp:</strong> pulver påføres elektrostatisk og herdes i ovn.</li>\n<li><strong>Styrker:</strong> jevn tykkelse, god slag- og ripebestandighet, mange farger og strukturer, uten løsemidler.</li>\n<li><strong>Begrensninger:</strong> delstørrelse begrenset av ovn og linje; tykke deler varmes sakte. Flekkreparasjon på stedet gjøres med våtlakk, og fargeforskjell kan synes.</li>\n<li><strong>Sveiserelatert risiko:</strong> luft i porer og trange spalter utvider seg under herding og gir nålestikk. På forsinket stål skjer lignende avgassing; forvarming eller egnet primer kan trengs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Våtlakk</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Prinsipp:</strong> påføres i lag (grunning, mellomstrøk, toppstrøk) med sprøyte eller pensel.</li>\n<li><strong>Styrker:</strong> ingen størrelsesgrense; tykke flerlagssystemer for høye ISO 12944-kategorier (se <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944</a>). Kan repareres på stedet med samme system.</li>\n<li><strong>Begrensninger:</strong> tørke- og overmalingstider, følsom for temperatur, fukt og duggpunkt.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Hva skal man velge?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Maskindeler, innendørs utstyr, mellomstore deler:</strong> pulver er ofte økonomisk og pent.</li>\n<li><strong>Store konstruksjoner, utendørs, marint og industrielt:</strong> flerlags våtlakk eller duplex.</li>\n<li><strong>Deler som kan skades under montasje:</strong> våtlakk er lettere å reparere.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Uansett</h2>\n<p>Forbehandlingen avgjør levetiden: angi blåsegrad, profil og sveiseforberedelse (se <a href=\"kumlama-sa-2-5-yuzey-hazirligi-kaynakli-parca.html\">blåserensing og Sa 2½</a>). Angi også opphengspunkter, maskering (gjenger, maskinerte flater, jordingspunkter), farge (RAL osv.), glans og tørrfilmtykkelse.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Hos ArmaWeld:</strong> vi forbereder delene for belegg og planlegger opphengspunkter og maskering allerede i produksjonen. Blåsing, pulverlakk, våtlakk og forsinking koordineres med partnere. <a href=\"../kaynakli-imalat.html\">Sveisefabrikasjon →</a></p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_faq":"<h2>Ofte stilte spørsmål</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Passer pulver for alle deler?</h3><p>Nei; ovnen begrenser størrelsen, og flekkreparasjon på stedet gjøres ikke med pulver.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hva er best utendørs?</h3><p>Ved høy korrosivitet flerlags våtlakk eller duplex.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvorfor nålestikk i pulver?</h3><p>Gass fra porer, spalter eller forsinking slipper ut under herding.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hva skal stå i ordren?</h3><p>Type, forbehandling, farge og glans, filmtykkelse og maskering.</p></div>","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_h3":"Trenger du malte sveisedeler?","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_p":"Send tegninger og beleggkrav; vi utarbeider tilbud.","blog_p108_powderwet_cta_btn":"Be om tilbud →","blog_related_h":"Relaterte artikler","blog_p107_blasting_h1":"Blåserensing og Sa 2½: bestill overflatebehandling av sveisedeler riktig","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 korrosivitetskategorier C1–C5 og CX: velge malingssystem for sveiset stål","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Slik konstruerer du sveiste deler for varmforsinking: hull, sveising og valg av stål","blog_p106_architectural_h1":"Arkitektonisk stål og synlige sveiser: utseendeklasser, prøvestykke og sliping"}};for(var l in d){var t=T[l]||(T[l]={});for(var k in d[l])t[k]=d[l][k];}})();
